-- Definitions bundle OAILP_HexBasic_OfFn
-- Generated by skeleton subtraction from HexBasic/OfFn.lean of the Lean 4.33.1 / Mathlib 0df444a
-- backport of OpenAI's formalization (github.com/openai/math, commit 3344da59991ed94f9ba711217b29c1d760badfa6),
